# Local env for the trade-agent frontend (project trade-agent-ff12a).
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) if you need to override anything. The public demo
# has no sign-in, so no Firebase values are needed - the only knob is the API base URL.

# Optional (local dev only). The API is same-origin in dev, so this defaults to "/api" (the Vite
# proxy forwards it to the local backend). Production does NOT use this default - it is pinned to the
# split-origin api. subdomain in the committed frontend/.env.production. Only set this locally to
# point dev at a non-same-origin backend.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
